---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
import Img from "./Img.astro";
import espacoAcolhimento from "../assets/espaco-acolhimento.jpg";
---

<div class="container">
  <SectionTitle class="md:hidden text-2xl font-bold font-poppins">Venha nos visitar</SectionTitle>
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse justify-between">
    <div class="relative lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center  items-end">
      <Img src={espacoAcolhimento} class="md:w-100 relative my-5 md:my-0 rounded-md "
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 400px, calc(100vw - 60px)" alt="Espaço de acolhimento Union Neil" />
    </div>

    <div class="gap-4 flex flex-col md:w-1/2 text-lg md:p-4">
      <SectionTitle class="hidden md:block text-2xl font-bold">Venha nos visitar</SectionTitle>
      <p>Agende uma visita conosco para conversarmos pessoalmente e juntos descobrirmos a melhor solução, acompanhados
        de um delicioso café mineiro.</p>
      <p>Estaremos encantados em recebê-los!</p>
      <div class="font-extrabold text-[#272727]">
        <div>Av. Washington Luiz 310</div>
        <div>Torre White, Sala 116</div>
        <div>Jardim Emilia</div>
        <div>Sorocaba</div>
        <div>SP</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Same Google Business profile link as the footer and reviews.json. -->
      <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=2645807140813797670" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="mt-2 self-center md:self-start flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[40px] border-2 border-[darkgoldenrod] bg-[rgb(184,134,11,0.15)] px-5 py-2.5 font-bold text-[#242424] shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg">
        <!-- Google Maps pin (2020 icon) -->
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 92.3 132.3" class="h-6 w-auto" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="#1a73e8" d="M60.2 2.2C55.8.8 51 0 46.1 0 32 0 19.3 6.4 10.8 16.5l21.8 18.3L60.2 2.2z" />
          <path fill="#ea4335" d="M10.8 16.5C4.1 24.5 0 34.9 0 46.1c0 8.7 1.7 15.7 4.6 22l28-33.3-21.8-18.3z" />
          <path fill="#4285f4" d="M46.2 28.5c9.8 0 17.7 7.9 17.7 17.7 0 4.3-1.6 8.3-4.2 11.4 0 0 13.9-16.6 27.5-32.7-5.6-10.8-15.3-19-27-22.7L32.6 34.8c3.3-3.8 8.1-6.3 13.6-6.3" />
          <path fill="#fbbc04" d="M46.2 63.8c-9.8 0-17.7-7.9-17.7-17.7 0-4.3 1.5-8.3 4.1-11.3l-28 33.3c4.8 10.6 12.8 19.2 21 29.9l34.1-40.5c-3.3 3.9-8.1 6.3-13.5 6.3" />
          <path fill="#34a853" d="M59.1 109.2c15.4-24.1 33.3-35 33.3-63 0-7.7-1.9-14.9-5.2-21.3L25.6 98c2.6 3.4 5.3 7.3 7.9 11.3 9.4 14.5 6.8 23.1 12.8 23.1s3.4-8.7 12.8-23.2" />
        </svg>
        Ver no Google Maps
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
